      {
        "text": "Bing Sai Chuan tosses Hei Lou Lan a rank seven Immortal Gu that looks like a black and gold beetle and feels very heavy. He names it strong Gu, says it is rule path, and says it suits her Great Strength True Martial Physique even though her path is strength. Hei Lou Lan recognizes Strong Gu from The Legends of Ren Zu and its close connection to that physique, and treats the gift as a legendary Immortal Gu meant to nurture her.",
